  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the milk and half the butter to the potato.\n• Mash until smooth and season to taste with salt and pepper. Cover to keep warm.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-1e794300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic and brown onion.\n• Trim green beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-1dddf310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook green beans, tossing, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season to taste, transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-a62f1e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out the frying pan, then return to high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil. Cook plant-based crumbed chicken with sliced mushrooms, until golden and heated through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add onion and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-75671f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato paste, garlic & herb seasoning, remaining garlic and remaining butter and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add light cooking cream, vegetable stock powder, Dijon mustard and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-e36fb240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mashed potato between bowls.\n• Top with plant-based crumbed chicken and mushroom stroganoff.\n• Serve with garlicky greens. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e23a077594446a7cdcbce2/step-19d82550.jpg"
    }
  ]
